# sublimapparel.com — Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# ============================================================================
# LLM-friendly files moved off the public root to avoid the
# Cloudflare auto-managed robots.txt feature from auto-injecting a
# "Sitemap: https://sublimapparel.com/llms.txt" line into the served
# /robots.txt (Cloudflare's auto-robots only sees files in public/ at
# the build step; hidden subdirectories are not auto-indexed).
#
# 200-status internal rewrites preserve the original URLs so AI
# crawlers (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, etc.) and the HTTP `Link: </llms.txt>;
# rel="describedby"` headers we emit still resolve correctly.
# ============================================================================

# /llms.txt is a small AEO card of the site for LLM discovery.
/llms.txt                 /llms/llms.txt                 200

# /llms-full.txt is the long-form version of the same AEO content.
/llms-full.txt            /llms/llms-full.txt            200
